      "created_at": "2020-03-25T03:06:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If a character has this Green ability:</p>\n<p>Attack using Strength. &nbsp;Recover Health equal to your Min die.</p>\n<p>...and this Red ability:</p>\n<p>Whenever you Attack a target with an action, also Hinder that target with your Min die.</p>\n<p>Can these abilities be used together? If so, would the Min die be used for 2 different effects? Or would the Red ability only apply to basic Attacks?</p>",
