      "created_at": "2020-03-25T16:04:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, this is why Endurance Fighting and Inspiring Totem are ridiculous.&nbsp; They are purely addative to anything else you're doing.&nbsp; I made a fan-build of Haka and she only had one actual Attack, a green Max-die Attack.&nbsp; Everything else is Boosts, Reactions, and those two Red abilities.</p>",
