      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/f6c823/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2020-03-25T23:23:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Even better if you can swing an AoE attack using a Mental Quality (say, Magical Lore) so that you can stack on the Min Die Reroll before determining effects!</p>\n<p>Of course, the drawback to such a strategy is that you *must* actually be in the Red zone to use it; unlike Red Action Abilities.</p>",
