    {
      "id": 230124,
      "name": "MindWanderer",
      "username": "MindWanderer",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mindwanderer/{size}/4816_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-03-25T23:56:27.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Reliable Aptitude and Magical Lore are Knowledge, not Mental.</p>\n<p>For super silliness: Elemental Manipulator, use External Combustion and Live Dangerously to burn your HP into the Red.&nbsp; Once in Red, use Live Dangerously with your Element+Magical Lore/Science/Technology, Endurance Fighting, Reliable Aptitude, and Improved Immunity.&nbsp; Be Naive or Nurturing for the d12 Red die, and make sure you have high HP!</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T06:05:03.003Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
